KNULLI configgen patch for the Join / Solo prompt and ES-lobby guests (part of handheld-link-cores)
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
Target: /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/configgen/emulatorlauncher.py, stock md5 96581451043c1ba63ff799c9d59f0bda
Apply on the device:  mount -o remount,rw / && patch -p1 -d / < emulatorlauncher.patch && knulli-save-overlay
Undo:                 patch -R -p1 -d / < emulatorlauncher.patch && knulli-save-overlay

--- a/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/configgen/emulatorlauncher.py
